title    Hellgate
composer Claude (ShooterCoaster)
about    Inferno option "hellgate": an orchestral boss rush in C minor at 150. Strings saw a sixteenth-note ostinato, brass and horns carry the hook in octaves, and timpani, orchestra hits and a gong punch the downbeats over a bigkick. The last eight bars lift a minor third, to E-flat minor. Layers: string ostinato and FM bass, then kick, snare, timpani and hits at 2x, brass and horns at 3x, a full choir and straight hats at FRENZY.
tempo    150
beats    4
steps    4
reverb   0.32

# untagged voices are the base layer; the intro plays every layer
voice str    strings   vol=0.32 pan=0.3 gate=0.7
voice bass   fmbass    vol=0.64 gate=0.6
voice kick   bigkick   vol=0.62 layer=drums
voice snare  snare     vol=0.6  pan=0.05 layer=drums
voice timp   timpani   vol=0.55 pan=-0.1 layer=drums
voice hit    orchhit   vol=0.42 layer=drums
voice gong   gong      vol=0.3  pan=-0.3 layer=drums
voice crash  crash     vol=0.3  pan=-0.2 layer=drums
voice brass  brass     vol=0.8  pan=-0.1 layer=lead
voice horn   horn      vol=0.5  pan=0.25 oct=-1 layer=lead
voice choir  voices    vol=0.32 pan=-0.3 center=C4 layer=frenzy
voice hat    hat909    vol=0.28 pan=0.4 layer=frenzy

pattern intro
str   | C4 C4 G4 C4 Eb4 C4 G4 C4 C4 C4 G4 C4 Eb4 C4 G4 C4 | D4 D4 B4 D4 G4 D4 B4 D4 D4 D4 B4 D4 G4 D4 B4 D4 |
hit   | [Cm]!--------------- | [G]!--- [G]!--- [G]!------- |
timp  | C2--- .--- C2--- .--- | G2--- G2--- G2- G2- G2 G2 G2 G2 |
gong  | x... .... .... .... | .... .... .... .... |

pattern A
brass | G4--- C5--- Eb5--- D5- C5- | Eb5------- C5--- Ab4--- | D5--- F5--- Bb5--- Ab5- G5- | G5------- F5- Eb5- D5- B4- |
